{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "notes": {
    "smoke": "Emulator-only guardrails. Startup uses Macrobenchmark timing; Reader page-turn smoke uses AndroidX gfxinfo metrics because the GitHub API 35 lavapipe emulator does not reliably emit Perfetto frame-timeline expect/actual slices. These are catastrophic-regression guardrails, not product performance claims.",
    "physical": "Initial Veil Reader product budgets for a representative physical device. Re-baseline only after an intentional performance review. Canonical Paper evidence also requires observed GPU draw, texture-upload, warm-capture and View.draw trace metrics; numeric limits for those traces are calibrated only after stable physical-device measurements."
  },
